B.Tf=s(["Aralar\u0131nda asal iki say\u0131n\u0131n EBOB'unun say\u0131lar\u0131n \xe7arp\u0131m\u0131na e\u015fit olmas\u0131","\u0130ki say\u0131n\u0131n EKOK'unun daima bu say\u0131lardan daha k\xfc\xe7\xfck bir de\u011fer \xe7\u0131kmas\u0131","B\xfct\xfcnden par\xe7aya giderken daima EKOK form\xfcl\xfcn\xfcn uygulanmas\u0131","Ard\u0131\u015f\u0131k iki do\u011fal say\u0131n\u0131n EBOB'unun daima 2 olmas\u0131"],t.s)
